        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FDB278, Solid Brass Floor Mount Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-7/8\" high floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FDB278-specifications.gif?v=1704354671\" width=\"400\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FBD278 door stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FDB278 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Center of Rubber Bumper: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-for-floor-door-stop-deltana-fdb218-rubber\"><b>Rubber Bumper</b></a>: 3/4\" Diameter, Gray Rubber</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDB278.pdf?v=1704262208\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  FDB278 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
