                "title": "2-7/8 Inch Floor Mount Door Stop",
                "description": "Solid Brass Floor Mount Door Bumper, Deltana FDB278 - The 2-7/8 inch high floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Deltana. This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty floor anchor for solid mounting. Available in 9 great finishes.",
